+test(
+  "a HUNG pending read still degrades: the deadline turns it into a countable failure",
+  async () => {
+    // The most likely real shape of this failure, and the one the pre-Part-B code
+    // could not recover from at all: a read that never answers. The SDK's default
+    // fetch sets req.timeout = false, so without reconcileDeadline `await onOpen`
+    // stays pending forever, the pump never starts, and the failure counter never
